WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:03:08.330
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
03:08.600 --> 03:10.000
Hathaya.

3
03:10.080 --> 03:13.080
You should teach your husband some manners.

4
03:13.160 --> 03:15.560
If it makes you uncomfortable,

5
03:16.160 --> 03:18.720
you and your daughter can move out and live somewhere else.

6
03:18.800 --> 03:19.800
You.

7
03:19.880 --> 03:20.800
Break up with Chayanee.

8
03:20.880 --> 03:22.960
I'll find you a woman who's better

9
03:23.040 --> 03:25.400
and more capable myself.

10
03:25.480 --> 03:26.680
PREVIOUSLY

11
03:26.760 --> 03:27.920
How much do you want this time?

12
03:28.000 --> 03:29.520
I'm only here to repay you.

13
03:29.600 --> 03:31.560
Even if he pays back a thousand times more,

14
03:31.640 --> 03:33.280
money can't buy our happiness back.

15
03:33.360 --> 03:35.760
But I want to be a good father to our son.

16
03:36.480 --> 03:37.840
What happened to your face?

17
03:37.920 --> 03:39.360
If that's all, please go.

18
03:50.400 --> 03:51.600
Well.

19
03:53.040 --> 03:56.960
So, your ex-husband came to see you.

20
03:57.040 --> 03:59.960
Why did you let him leave so quickly?

21
04:00.040 --> 04:03.960
Why didn't you invite him upstairs so you could talk in our bedroom?

22
04:05.600 --> 04:07.520
Anon only stopped by to take care of something.

23
04:07.600 --> 04:09.920
And I already told him not to come here again.

24
04:10.000 --> 04:12.520
Oh, really?

25
04:12.600 --> 04:15.280
I'm not jealous or possessive.

26
04:15.360 --> 04:17.320
I trust you.

27
04:17.399 --> 04:21.880
I know you're someone who understands gratitude.

28
04:22.560 --> 04:23.920
You wouldn't betray me.

29
04:25.280 --> 04:26.120
Hm?

30
04:27.920 --> 04:31.040
Have you eaten yet? I prepared food for you. There's soup too.

31
04:31.120 --> 04:34.480
No, no. I'm full.

32
04:36.440 --> 04:37.640
Let's go cash that check.

33
04:37.720 --> 04:39.000
No.

34
04:39.080 --> 04:40.920
I can't give it to you.

35
04:41.000 --> 04:43.560
That money belongs to Ramil. I'm giving it back to him.

36
04:43.640 --> 04:46.000
He saved that money to build a house.

37
04:46.080 --> 04:47.480
Really?

38
04:47.560 --> 04:51.000
Ramil is living at Mr. Pichai's house now.

39
04:51.080 --> 04:53.160
Do you understand how comfortable his life is?

40
04:53.240 --> 04:54.720
He doesn't need this money.

41
04:54.800 --> 04:57.360
Get it? I need this money. Come on. We're going to the bank.

42
04:57.440 --> 04:59.120
No. I can't give it to you.

43
04:59.640 --> 05:01.960
You can't?

44
05:02.040 --> 05:03.920
You can't give it to me?

45
05:04.000 --> 05:06.840
I told you to give me the money.

46
05:06.920 --> 05:08.360
Give it to me.

47
05:08.440 --> 05:10.960
No. I won't give it to you.

48
05:11.040 --> 05:12.320
-Give it to me. -No.

49
05:12.400 --> 05:14.480
If I don't have this, I'm going to prison.

50
05:15.160 --> 05:18.480
Do you understand? I'm going to prison. I need this money to settle the case.

51
05:18.560 --> 05:20.000
Give it to me.

52
05:21.840 --> 05:23.720
Give me the money.

53
05:26.880 --> 05:28.320
No…

54
05:28.400 --> 05:31.720
Listen to me.

55
05:31.800 --> 05:34.080
I know you don't have any feelings for me anymore.

56
05:35.520 --> 05:36.800
Fine.

57
05:38.120 --> 05:41.320
I won't torment you anymore. I'll let you go.

58
05:41.400 --> 05:43.760
You can start a new life.

59
05:43.840 --> 05:46.880
You can go live with your precious son.

60
05:47.600 --> 05:48.480
Okay?

61
05:49.880 --> 05:51.280
Now give me the money.

62
05:55.160 --> 05:56.800
Promise me.

63
05:57.400 --> 06:00.640
If I give you this money, you'll really let me go.

64
06:04.000 --> 06:08.080
Come on. Get up.

65
06:11.360 --> 06:13.320
You can trust me.

66
06:14.000 --> 06:15.320
At the very least,

67
06:16.600 --> 06:19.880
I used to be your husband.

68
06:21.240 --> 06:22.560
Give me the check.

69
06:30.400 --> 06:31.760
I'll give you the money.

70
06:37.200 --> 06:39.120
We'll go to the bank together.

71
06:39.200 --> 06:42.280
Here. Go upstairs and fix your makeup

72
06:42.360 --> 06:44.040
and your hair.

73
06:44.800 --> 06:47.760
Go on, sweetheart. Go get ready.

74
06:48.280 --> 06:49.720
Then we'll go to the bank.

75
06:58.960 --> 07:00.240
Mom.

76
07:00.320 --> 07:01.720
Raiwin threatened to leave me.

77
07:01.800 --> 07:03.760
I don't know where else to find the money.

78
07:05.480 --> 07:07.880
Chayanee, listen to me.

79
07:07.960 --> 07:10.800
You've already wasted enough money on those leeches.

80
07:10.880 --> 07:13.320
You spent ten million helping with the election campaign,

81
07:13.400 --> 07:15.080
and now they still have the nerve

82
07:15.160 --> 07:17.200
to ask you to help settle his case.

83
07:17.280 --> 07:20.040
Just break up with him.

84
07:20.120 --> 07:23.840
How about this? I'll find you a good man

85
07:23.920 --> 07:27.040
who's right for you.

86
07:27.120 --> 07:28.720
No, Mom.

87
07:28.800 --> 07:31.840
I've already invested too much. I'm not taking a loss.

88
07:31.920 --> 07:34.960
What's gone is gone.

89
07:35.040 --> 07:36.400
Just leave him.

90
07:36.480 --> 07:37.880
I can't.

91
07:37.960 --> 07:41.440
Is there something else going on? Or do you really love him that much?

92
07:42.240 --> 07:46.760
Can you stop asking so many questions? I'm stressed.

93
07:46.840 --> 07:48.040
Ugh.

94
07:49.960 --> 07:52.120
Madam, how about this?

95
07:52.200 --> 07:56.200
I've saved 20 or 30,000.

96
07:56.280 --> 07:58.320
You can borrow mine first.

97
07:58.400 --> 08:01.080
We're practically family.

98
08:01.160 --> 08:02.920
I'll only charge 20% interest.

99
08:03.480 --> 08:04.880
-Chamoi. -Yes?

100
08:04.960 --> 08:06.040
Get out.

101
08:06.120 --> 08:07.480
Yes.

102
08:09.800 --> 08:12.960
Chayanee, honey.

103
08:25.680 --> 08:27.280
If Grandpa dies,

104
08:29.160 --> 08:32.919
his inheritance will go to you.

105
08:34.919 --> 08:37.320
Are you wishing your grandfather dead?

106
08:40.480 --> 08:42.320
No, Mom.

107
08:42.400 --> 08:46.520
I'm just saying the inheritance still belongs to us right now.

108
08:48.240 --> 08:51.080
Father hasn't called his lawyer to discuss the will.

109
08:51.160 --> 08:54.840
What if he already changed it and left everything to Hathaya?

110
08:58.280 --> 09:00.280
Mom, you have to give me the money.

111
09:01.040 --> 09:02.040
Oh?

112
09:02.760 --> 09:06.560
I don't have any. I don't have any savings left.

113
09:06.640 --> 09:09.560
Mom. Mom.

114
09:10.240 --> 09:12.560
Mom. Mom.

115
09:12.640 --> 09:14.840
Mom, you have to help me with the money first.

116
09:15.360 --> 09:19.040
You've asked me for so much that I really don't have any savings left.

117
09:20.400 --> 09:23.240
What about the money you had Hathai take from the office?

118
09:23.320 --> 09:24.920
That was five million.

119
09:25.520 --> 09:28.040
The economy is bad right now.

120
09:28.120 --> 09:29.760
I need to keep some money for myself.

121
09:30.600 --> 09:32.040
Mom.

122
09:32.120 --> 09:34.000
Let me use it first.

123
09:34.080 --> 09:36.640
I promise I'll pay you back ten times over.

124
09:36.720 --> 09:39.280
I don't have it.

125
09:39.360 --> 09:40.600
Who's there?

126
09:41.160 --> 09:42.600
I asked who's there.

127
09:55.480 --> 09:56.320
Beautiful.

128
09:59.440 --> 10:03.320
Of course. Grandma Duangjai planted these herself.

129
10:05.840 --> 10:10.240
I wasn't talking about the flower. I meant…

130
10:11.880 --> 10:15.080
Aren't you supposed to be going to work?

131
10:15.160 --> 10:19.320
I'm going to take this vase to Grandpa, then we can leave for work.

132
10:20.480 --> 10:22.600
There's nothing you need to do at the office.

133
10:23.840 --> 10:27.320
Stay here and take care of Grandpa. I'll handle things at the development.

134
10:30.240 --> 10:31.280
Thank you.

135
10:34.680 --> 10:37.720
Aren't you going to give me one?

136
10:57.240 --> 10:59.440
MR. THONGSIT

137
11:00.200 --> 11:01.440
Hello, sir.

138
11:02.400 --> 11:04.280
Absolutely, sir.

139
11:04.360 --> 11:06.200
I'll bring it over--

140
11:06.280 --> 11:09.680
Yes, sir. I'll bring it to you right away.

141
11:09.760 --> 11:11.760
As soon as possible.

142
11:11.840 --> 11:14.840
Yes, sir. Thank you so very much.

143
11:14.920 --> 11:16.840
Yes. Goodbye.

144
11:19.560 --> 11:20.840
How did it go, Dad?

145
11:20.920 --> 11:23.840
I've already paid part of it.

146
11:23.920 --> 11:25.840
I'm just waiting to pay the last installment.

147
11:26.480 --> 11:30.160
What about your Chayanee? Has she gotten the money yet?

148
11:30.760 --> 11:33.240
The other day, she went and caused a scene with Ingorn.

149
11:34.320 --> 11:37.480
My plan to get money from Ingorn is ruined now.

150
11:37.560 --> 11:39.560
I don't want to talk to Chayanee anymore.

151
11:45.960 --> 11:47.200
Chayanee's calling.

152
11:47.280 --> 11:49.760
CHAYANEE

153
11:50.280 --> 11:53.280
Hang up. I'm telling you right now.

154
11:53.360 --> 11:56.160
If she can't get the money, you have to break up with her.

155
12:02.480 --> 12:05.080
Raiwin, I found the money to help your father.

156
12:06.080 --> 12:07.760
That's more like it.

157
12:07.840 --> 12:11.600
If she sends you a message like that, call her back right now.

158
12:13.480 --> 12:16.400
Raiwin. I told you to call her.

159
12:16.480 --> 12:17.960
Now.

160
12:20.680 --> 12:21.600
Well?

161
12:29.320 --> 12:32.280
Five million baht, and I'm giving it to those leeches.

162
12:33.960 --> 12:36.360
Forget it. Consider it an investment.

163
12:36.440 --> 12:40.920
If I lose five million, I'd better get a hundred million or a billion back.

164
12:48.160 --> 12:52.240
I've been waiting forever. When is your mother bringing the money?

165
12:52.920 --> 12:56.520
She went to withdraw it. She should be here soon.

166
13:00.800 --> 13:02.840
There she is. Mom.

167
13:04.280 --> 13:06.240
Well, madam.

168
13:06.320 --> 13:08.280
Forgot how to answer your phone?

169
13:08.360 --> 13:11.200
Pong. Pong must be trying to steal Mom's money.

170
13:11.280 --> 13:13.080
You have to help her.

171
13:15.120 --> 13:16.080
Hm?

172
13:17.520 --> 13:19.400
Don't you miss me, madam?

173
13:21.840 --> 13:25.760
Because I want you to know I've missed you very much.

174
13:35.120 --> 13:36.880
Where did Mom go?

175
13:39.600 --> 13:44.040
Did you really bring the money for me, or are you playing some kind of game?

176
13:45.440 --> 13:49.440
I came here to give you the money. I had no idea Pong was going to show up.

177
13:51.520 --> 13:53.000
Madam.

178
13:54.360 --> 13:56.440
I warned you.

179
13:57.400 --> 14:00.840
If I have to find you myself, it's going to be a lot worse.

180
14:02.120 --> 14:04.080
What if something's happened to Mom?

181
14:05.160 --> 14:06.680
I should call her.

182
14:09.960 --> 14:11.120
What's it going to be?

183
14:11.200 --> 14:13.960
Why are you calling me now?

184
14:27.920 --> 14:29.080
Come on.

185
14:34.040 --> 14:37.200
Mom. Where are you? Did Pong do something to you?

186
14:37.280 --> 14:39.480
I'm not going to hurt your mother, miss.

187
14:39.560 --> 14:41.720
She's perfectly safe.

188
14:44.600 --> 14:46.000
If you don't want serious charges,

189
14:46.080 --> 14:48.400
let Ms. Liu go. Where are you?

190
14:50.600 --> 14:51.560
Huh?

191
14:59.360 --> 15:00.400
What do you want?

192
15:02.480 --> 15:03.680
What do I want?

193
15:04.840 --> 15:06.800
You won't answer my calls.

194
15:07.320 --> 15:09.280
I kept calling,

195
15:10.560 --> 15:12.360
and you were trying to ditch me?

196
15:12.960 --> 15:15.440
I told you to go into hiding.

197
15:15.520 --> 15:19.040
If anything happened, I'd contact you.

198
15:19.120 --> 15:21.240
The police are hunting me everywhere.

199
15:22.000 --> 15:24.160
How can I find work? I don't even have any money.

200
15:24.880 --> 15:27.920
I called you because I needed money for food,

201
15:28.000 --> 15:29.560
and you wouldn't answer.

202
15:30.960 --> 15:31.880
Here. Take this.

203
15:32.480 --> 15:35.360
Take it and don't contact me again.

204
15:37.080 --> 15:38.680
At first, this was all I wanted,

205
15:39.360 --> 15:41.120
but then I thought about it.

206
15:42.000 --> 15:45.480
I worked damn hard to get that money.

207
15:46.200 --> 15:47.440
I deserve a cut.

208
15:48.120 --> 15:51.080
You were already paid more than enough, Pong.

209
15:52.880 --> 15:53.920
Madam.

210
15:55.600 --> 15:57.120
I'm not your employee.

211
15:58.680 --> 16:00.280
I'm your lover.

212
16:00.360 --> 16:03.920
You idiot. Stop talking nonsense.

213
16:06.120 --> 16:08.880
Fine. So that's how you want to play it?

214
16:10.960 --> 16:15.440
Then maybe you should look at your own moves in bed.

215
16:18.280 --> 16:19.560
It’s awesome!

216
16:20.080 --> 16:21.600
Well?

217
16:23.920 --> 16:26.640
You set up a camera and recorded me?

218
16:26.720 --> 16:28.000
Of course.

219
16:29.000 --> 16:30.760
I like keeping these to watch later.

220
16:32.880 --> 16:35.040
You bastard. Delete it right now.

221
16:35.120 --> 16:37.520
-Delete it. -These days, you need evidence.

222
16:37.600 --> 16:38.880
Madam, let go.

223
16:43.120 --> 16:44.640
If you want me to delete it,

224
16:46.080 --> 16:47.040
give me the money.

225
16:47.880 --> 16:49.720
The whole bag.

226
16:50.720 --> 16:51.880
Come on.

227
16:54.240 --> 16:56.720
Fine.

228
16:57.760 --> 16:59.360
Think about it.

229
16:59.440 --> 17:02.400
If your father-in-law finds out you slept with me,

230
17:02.480 --> 17:04.200
you won't have a roof over your head.

231
17:05.880 --> 17:06.880
And more importantly,

232
17:07.960 --> 17:11.960
what happens if the police find out you hired me to rape Hathaya?

233
17:12.760 --> 17:14.720
Twice, madam.

234
17:16.560 --> 17:17.480
What will your life be like?

235
17:17.560 --> 17:18.880
Pong.

236
17:20.000 --> 17:22.359
You monster. You bastard.

237
17:22.440 --> 17:26.160
Go ahead. Hit me harder.

238
17:29.640 --> 17:31.600
If you'd answered me, none of this would have happened.

239
17:33.120 --> 17:34.240
Do you know how to answer?

240
17:35.560 --> 17:36.680
Damn it.

241
17:39.760 --> 17:40.880
Pong…

242
17:48.560 --> 17:49.680
Mom.

243
17:50.440 --> 17:52.800
Mom. Did he do anything to you?

244
17:54.240 --> 17:55.600
I'm fine, sweetheart.

245
17:55.680 --> 17:57.720
I'm calling the police to have him arrested.

246
17:57.800 --> 17:58.800
Don't.

247
17:59.400 --> 18:02.360
If you do, Pong will expose everything about me.

248
18:04.040 --> 18:05.640
The money's all still there, right?

249
18:05.720 --> 18:06.680
Well…

250
18:07.600 --> 18:09.080
Mom, give Raiwin the money.

251
18:11.640 --> 18:14.440
Take this to your father and use it to settle the case,

252
18:14.520 --> 18:16.400
and set a wedding date as soon as possible.

253
18:22.040 --> 18:23.240
What kind of game is this?

254
18:28.600 --> 18:30.120
Where's the money, Mom?

255
18:31.560 --> 18:35.120
Pong took all of my money.

256
18:36.120 --> 18:37.120
Mom.

257
18:43.800 --> 18:45.360
What a waste of time.

258
18:45.440 --> 18:47.400
Wait. Come back.

259
18:47.480 --> 18:48.640
Wait.

260
18:49.720 --> 18:51.120
I'm scared.

261
19:01.160 --> 19:02.440
Your medicine, Grandpa.

262
19:03.120 --> 19:05.200
I added some vitamins too.

263
19:05.280 --> 19:08.480
I want you to get stronger and be able to walk normally again soon.

264
19:18.440 --> 19:20.280
Miss Hathaya, the food is ready.

265
19:20.880 --> 19:22.320
Thank you, Aunt Ann.

266
19:23.280 --> 19:24.760
Who is that for?

267
19:27.040 --> 19:30.040
I heard Aunt Liu isn't feeling well.

268
19:30.120 --> 19:31.800
I'm going to take some food to her room.

269
19:34.160 --> 19:37.720
You know she doesn't exactly like you and you're still making food for her?

270
19:40.760 --> 19:45.000
Aunt Liu and Chayanee are still my family, Grandpa.

271
19:53.600 --> 19:55.480
I'll excuse myself.

272
19:56.080 --> 19:57.680
I'll carry it.

273
20:03.040 --> 20:05.920
Then I'll take you back to your room, sir.

274
20:06.600 --> 20:08.160
Alright. Thank you.

275
20:10.360 --> 20:11.480
Let's go.

276
20:19.320 --> 20:20.560
Why did you come in?

277
20:22.040 --> 20:23.520
Don't you have any manners?

278
20:25.040 --> 20:28.400
I'm sorry. The door was open.

279
20:28.480 --> 20:31.840
I brought food for Aunt Liu and you.

280
20:34.320 --> 20:36.440
Where's Aunt Chamoi? Why is anyone allowed in?

281
20:38.640 --> 20:39.520
Well…

282
20:40.080 --> 20:44.120
Madam sent me to find lozenges, an inhaler, and ointment.

283
20:44.200 --> 20:46.960
By the time I found everything, I was exhausted.

284
20:47.040 --> 20:48.320
Get out.

285
20:48.960 --> 20:52.600
And close the door. Don't let anyone come in and bother Mom again.

286
20:53.200 --> 20:54.040
Yes.

287
20:54.600 --> 20:57.720
Next time, don't stick your nose in here.

288
20:57.800 --> 21:00.000
I'm the one who gets in trouble because of you.

289
21:01.720 --> 21:02.840
Aunt Chamoi.

290
21:03.800 --> 21:06.240
I know you haven't eaten yet.

291
21:06.320 --> 21:08.680
I left some food for you in the kitchen.

292
21:08.760 --> 21:12.440
When you have time, go eat it before you get sick too.

293
21:22.440 --> 21:24.160
Why are you just standing there?

294
21:24.240 --> 21:26.720
Go make food for Mom.

295
21:29.000 --> 21:30.480
Miss Hathaya already made some.

296
21:30.560 --> 21:32.040
I'm not eating that.

297
21:33.280 --> 21:36.040
If they made it, they probably poisoned it to kill us.

298
21:37.680 --> 21:41.600
Go make some food. Then feed Mom, give her water, and massage her feet.

299
21:43.280 --> 21:44.360
And most importantly,

300
21:45.560 --> 21:47.040
sleep here with her tonight.

301
21:47.120 --> 21:49.240
Aren't you staying with her, miss?

302
21:49.320 --> 21:52.880
I'm stressed. I'm going out for drinks.

303
22:13.800 --> 22:16.200
Mom, stop crying.

304
22:16.280 --> 22:18.680
What's gone is gone.

305
22:19.520 --> 22:22.560
Those tears aren't going to turn back into money.

306
22:25.480 --> 22:29.880
I'm scared. I'm afraid he'll release the video.

307
22:31.280 --> 22:32.280
What video?

308
22:32.880 --> 22:34.160
The video from when…

309
22:35.160 --> 22:39.240
When I ordered him to rape Hathaya.

310
22:41.840 --> 22:44.160
You really can't tame a born criminal.

311
22:45.360 --> 22:47.040
This is all Pong's fault.

312
22:48.360 --> 22:50.600
I called Raiwin, and he won't answer.

313
22:50.680 --> 22:52.840
I went to his house and office, and he wouldn't see me.

314
22:55.440 --> 22:58.000
Then, where are you going to get the money?

315
23:04.520 --> 23:05.560
Grandpa.

316
23:05.640 --> 23:09.080
Grandpa isn't going to give us any more money.

317
23:11.000 --> 23:13.200
If Grandpa won't give it to me, then I won't ask.

318
23:13.720 --> 23:15.080
I'll steal it.

319
23:19.440 --> 23:22.440
I know where Grandpa keeps the key to the safe.

320
23:24.520 --> 23:28.960
But right now, Hathaya and Ramil stay glued to Grandpa all the time.

321
23:29.040 --> 23:30.440
You have to help me, Mom.

322
23:41.520 --> 23:42.480
Hello.

323
23:45.760 --> 23:47.880
Yes. Thank you very much.

324
23:52.040 --> 23:52.960
Ramil.

325
23:54.600 --> 23:55.560
Is something wrong?

326
23:56.560 --> 23:59.240
Someone from the Subdistrict Office called me.

327
23:59.320 --> 24:02.000
Raiwin is planning another streetlight project,

328
24:02.080 --> 24:04.560
and Mr. Saksit is talking to a contractor.

329
24:05.320 --> 24:06.920
I'm gonna find evidence against them.

330
24:08.320 --> 24:11.120
If they get caught, their futures will be ruined.

331
24:12.720 --> 24:14.520
I meant what I said before.

332
24:14.600 --> 24:16.480
Even if they're family,

333
24:16.560 --> 24:18.960
if they do something wrong, I won't let it slide.

334
24:30.320 --> 24:33.520
Max, take care of the site for me.

335
24:34.360 --> 24:35.560
I'm going to record evidence

336
24:36.320 --> 24:38.040
of Subdistrict Office bid rigging.

337
24:40.120 --> 24:41.120
I have to go.

338
24:46.240 --> 24:49.400
I came up with this project specifically for you.

339
24:49.480 --> 24:53.880
Aren't you afraid this will cause problems like the old cases?

340
24:54.920 --> 24:58.720
Those old cases? I've already taken care of all of them.

341
24:58.800 --> 25:00.160
The real question is,

342
25:00.760 --> 25:04.240
how many millions in kickbacks are you giving me for this project?

343
25:04.800 --> 25:08.160
And when this project is done, I'll have Chief Raiwin

344
25:08.240 --> 25:10.720
create another project specifically for you.

345
25:10.800 --> 25:13.760
Listen to me.

346
25:14.360 --> 25:15.800
Every job goes to you.

347
25:16.440 --> 25:19.640
Go have your children and your wife

348
25:19.720 --> 25:23.080
register companies now so they're ready to take my contracts.

349
25:23.680 --> 25:24.960
That works for me.

350
25:30.760 --> 25:34.800
Ramil, shouldn't you be at the site? What are you doing here?

351
25:35.400 --> 25:36.960
I could ask you the same thing.

352
25:38.120 --> 25:41.120
Shouldn't you be at the Subdistrict Office? What are you doing here?

353
25:42.840 --> 25:44.120
I had to do something nearby.

354
25:45.040 --> 25:46.280
So did I.

355
25:47.480 --> 25:48.560
Wait.

356
25:49.840 --> 25:54.120
We hardly see each other. Why the rush? Why don't we talk for a while?

357
25:54.200 --> 25:55.960
We can talk later.

358
25:56.680 --> 25:57.640
Oh.

359
25:58.560 --> 26:02.840
Is stopping me what you came here to do?

360
26:05.400 --> 26:08.200
Stopping you from what? Why would you say that?

361
26:08.280 --> 26:12.880
Your father arranged to meet a contractor about the streetlight project.

362
26:15.400 --> 26:16.600
Funny…

363
26:18.680 --> 26:20.360
how they're meeting unofficially.

364
26:24.800 --> 26:25.640
Ramil.

365
26:31.840 --> 26:32.840
Where's the contractor?

366
26:33.640 --> 26:34.560
Who?

367
26:34.640 --> 26:37.480
The contractor you arranged to meet about the kickbacks.

368
26:40.840 --> 26:41.920
Ramil.

369
26:45.320 --> 26:48.240
You misunderstood. Dad and I came here to eat together.

370
26:50.880 --> 26:53.520
You've been watching too much news.

371
26:53.600 --> 26:56.760
You abandoned your work just to come catch me doing something wrong?

372
26:57.400 --> 26:59.360
You want to be a good person that badly?

373
26:59.440 --> 27:01.440
I've never thought of myself as a good person,

374
27:01.520 --> 27:03.320
but what I'm doing,

375
27:03.400 --> 27:05.720
I'm doing as a responsible citizen.

376
27:05.800 --> 27:07.440
I'm protecting the public's interests.

377
27:08.520 --> 27:10.000
You ungrateful bastard.

378
27:10.080 --> 27:13.440
Someone like you never thinks about everything I did raising you.

379
27:13.520 --> 27:17.720
You're not even half the person your mom is.

380
27:19.120 --> 27:23.040
Your mother was willing to give me

381
27:23.120 --> 27:26.360
the wedding ring she saved for you to use

382
27:28.320 --> 27:29.280
when you got engaged.

383
27:30.320 --> 27:33.520
She gave it to me to sell so I could use the money to settle my case.

384
27:34.360 --> 27:35.880
If only you understood

385
27:37.240 --> 27:40.760
gratitude half as well as your mom does.

386
27:41.440 --> 27:43.720
Get this through your skull.

387
27:45.080 --> 27:47.720
No matter how hard you try to catch me doing something wrong,

388
27:48.400 --> 27:49.720
you can't touch me.

389
27:51.880 --> 27:54.400
Politicians like us

390
27:55.400 --> 27:57.040
never run out of connections.

391
27:59.720 --> 28:01.560
You know? Connections.

392
28:05.040 --> 28:06.680
People like us

393
28:07.960 --> 28:09.240
are impossible to kill.

394
28:14.160 --> 28:17.960
Enough, Ramil. No matter what happens, we're still brothers.

395
28:20.200 --> 28:23.200
During the campaign, you made all those promises

396
28:24.400 --> 28:26.000
about taking care of the people.

397
28:26.760 --> 28:27.840
What about now?

398
28:29.480 --> 28:31.240
Are you proud of yourself?

399
28:34.280 --> 28:36.560
Or are you just happy you're the Subdistrict Chief now?

400
28:37.720 --> 28:40.120
That mask you wear might look impressive.

401
28:40.200 --> 28:44.280
It might look dignified. But I can't see your face anymore.

402
28:46.360 --> 28:48.080
All I see is…

403
28:50.160 --> 28:51.160
your father's face.

404
29:04.600 --> 29:08.480
Grandpa, this book is really good.

405
29:08.560 --> 29:13.320
It's easy to understand. It teaches us how to let go and stop clinging to things.

406
29:19.480 --> 29:21.640
Hey.

407
29:22.440 --> 29:24.080
Why did you come in? Mr. Pichai didn't call you.

408
29:25.760 --> 29:28.040
I'm sorry, sir.

409
29:28.120 --> 29:32.960
Madam asked if Ann could come help me with something in the kitchen.

410
29:34.240 --> 29:38.480
Why? There are plenty of other maids. I need to look after him.

411
29:40.040 --> 29:42.840
Come on. If you don't go,

412
29:42.920 --> 29:45.560
Madam is going to come after me.

413
29:46.240 --> 29:47.560
I'm not going.

414
29:49.520 --> 29:52.320
Please. I'll get down and beg if I have to.

415
29:52.400 --> 29:53.640
Please come.

416
29:53.720 --> 29:57.480
-Otherwise, I'm going to get yelled at. -Go on. Don't worry about me.

417
29:58.560 --> 30:01.800
Hathaya is here to look after me. Go on.

418
30:04.360 --> 30:07.280
Go ahead, Aunt Ann. Come back when you're done.

419
30:08.360 --> 30:09.440
Thank you.

420
30:10.160 --> 30:11.240
All right.

421
30:11.320 --> 30:12.840
Come on.

422
30:12.920 --> 30:14.080
Hurry up.

423
30:22.880 --> 30:25.680
Chamoi, what does Madam want me to do?

424
30:25.760 --> 30:26.600
I don't know.

425
30:26.680 --> 30:29.760
-Then why did you come get me? -I don't know.

426
30:29.840 --> 30:32.160
-Do you know anything? -I don't know.

427
30:32.240 --> 30:35.160
If you say that one more time, I'm pushing you down these stairs.

428
30:35.240 --> 30:36.680
Hey, don't.

429
30:36.760 --> 30:40.720
From this height, I might not die, but I'd definitely end up disabled.

430
30:40.800 --> 30:42.240
You don't know anything.

431
30:42.320 --> 30:44.240
Come on. Hurry up.

432
30:44.320 --> 30:47.400
I need to get back and help Miss Hathaya take care of Mr. Pichai.

433
30:47.480 --> 30:48.520
Move.

434
30:48.600 --> 30:50.080
Stop pushing me.

435
30:50.160 --> 30:52.000
-Go. -Come on.

436
31:42.240 --> 31:43.680
Grandpa.

437
31:45.080 --> 31:46.600
I'm so happy

438
31:47.520 --> 31:49.720
I got to come back and take care of you

439
31:50.400 --> 31:52.000
and that I get to be with you again.

440
32:19.320 --> 32:21.320
Aunt Liu, what's wrong?

441
32:22.040 --> 32:25.360
Hathaya, come talk to me outside.

442
32:25.440 --> 32:28.400
There's something I need to discuss with you.

443
32:29.080 --> 32:31.280
I'm taking care of Grandpa.

444
32:34.880 --> 32:36.600
Can we talk this evening?

445
32:39.280 --> 32:41.560
It's really important.

446
32:42.800 --> 32:46.400
I'm only asking for ten minutes. Please.

447
32:59.760 --> 33:00.960
Okay. Let's go.

448
33:02.720 --> 33:03.760
Okay.

449
33:12.320 --> 33:15.040
Aunt Liu, we can talk here.

450
33:15.120 --> 33:19.240
It's personal. I don't want the maids hearing it.

451
33:34.960 --> 33:38.280
What did you want to talk to me about? I need to get back to Grandpa.

452
33:40.120 --> 33:41.360
How much money do you want?

453
33:43.120 --> 33:44.120
For what?

454
33:44.200 --> 33:46.360
Leave this place.

455
33:46.440 --> 33:49.240
I'm prepared to make you the best offer possible.

456
33:51.200 --> 33:54.000
If that's all you wanted to say, I'll excuse myself.

457
33:54.080 --> 33:55.120
Wait.

458
34:26.120 --> 34:27.280
What are you doing?

459
34:31.280 --> 34:32.199
Grandpa.

460
34:34.199 --> 34:38.400
How could you do this? I never taught any of my grandchildren to be thieves.

461
34:41.120 --> 34:43.080
Close the safe and get out right now.

462
34:45.199 --> 34:48.360
Chayanee. Why are you doing this?

463
34:50.520 --> 34:52.120
Stop right now.

464
34:52.199 --> 34:54.760
You already hate me anyway.

465
34:54.840 --> 34:58.160
These days, you barely even speak to me. You act like I don't exist.

466
34:58.240 --> 35:00.720
You know why I've been like that.

467
35:01.400 --> 35:03.600
You know why I feel this way. You did this to yourself.

468
35:06.200 --> 35:07.200
That's not true.

469
35:09.040 --> 35:10.920
You don't love me because of Hathaya.

470
35:11.000 --> 35:13.520
She took everything away from me.

471
35:13.600 --> 35:15.160
Everything Hathaya does is great.

472
35:15.240 --> 35:17.120
You let her bring Ramil into the house,

473
35:17.200 --> 35:19.200
but you refuse to accept Raiwin.

474
35:19.280 --> 35:22.200
You keep trying to stop me from marrying him.

475
35:23.200 --> 35:26.960
You know, and I know, that Raiwin has never been sincere with anyone.

476
35:27.040 --> 35:29.040
He has never truly loved anyone.

477
35:29.120 --> 35:31.680
He still lives under his father's shadow.

478
35:31.760 --> 35:33.480
How can someone like that truly love you?

479
35:33.560 --> 35:35.040
That's not true.

480
35:35.120 --> 35:38.600
Hathaya stays glued to you and keeps turning you against Raiwin.

481
35:38.680 --> 35:41.400
She makes you hate me too. That's why you don't love me anymore.

482
35:41.480 --> 35:43.080
Everything I do is wrong.

483
35:43.160 --> 35:44.560
You said it yourself.

484
35:44.640 --> 35:47.400
You don't love me anymore. You don't care about me anymore.

485
35:48.120 --> 35:49.320
Chayanee.

486
35:50.400 --> 35:53.000
You are my flesh and blood.

487
35:53.680 --> 35:55.880
No matter how angry I am with you,

488
35:56.400 --> 35:58.080
I will always love you.

489
35:59.880 --> 36:00.720
Chayanee.

490
36:03.720 --> 36:07.080
I'm giving you a chance to make this right. Start your life over.

491
36:14.600 --> 36:16.360
It's too late, Grandpa.

492
36:18.040 --> 36:20.760
If I start over from zero now,

493
36:22.160 --> 36:24.320
Hathaya will be above me.

494
36:29.080 --> 36:30.880
Stop, Chayanee.

495
36:30.960 --> 36:33.240
If you take that money out of this room,

496
36:33.880 --> 36:36.040
you are no longer my granddaughter.

497
36:42.040 --> 36:44.120
Then I'm calling the police right now.

498
36:44.200 --> 36:45.280
Stop, Grandpa.

499
36:46.920 --> 36:48.520
Stop. Give me the phone.

500
36:48.600 --> 36:49.560
-Stop. -Don't call them.

501
36:49.640 --> 36:51.560
-Stop. Don't grab it. -Give it to me.

502
36:52.760 --> 36:54.280
I've never had a thief for a grandchild.

503
37:01.120 --> 37:04.680
-Grandpa. -Come back.

504
37:07.360 --> 37:08.320
We haven't finished.

505
37:08.920 --> 37:11.560
I already told you I have nothing to discuss with you.

506
37:13.480 --> 37:14.320
Five million.

507
37:18.120 --> 37:19.200
Ten million.

508
37:20.200 --> 37:22.120
Wait.

509
37:23.120 --> 37:24.520
-Help. -Grandpa.

510
37:24.600 --> 37:26.120
-Help. -Stop right now.

511
37:26.200 --> 37:27.960
-Help. -Grandpa.

512
37:28.040 --> 37:29.760
-Help. -Don't, Grandpa.

513
37:29.840 --> 37:31.960
-Grandpa. -Stop it.

514
37:32.040 --> 37:33.880
-Grandpa. -Help.

515
37:35.160 --> 37:36.040
Grandpa.

516
37:37.760 --> 37:39.280
-Help. -Grandpa.

517
37:40.280 --> 37:42.680
Twenty million. Then get out of this house for good.

518
37:43.320 --> 37:47.400
I wouldn't take a hundred million or a billion.

519
37:47.480 --> 37:49.240
I'm staying here to take care of Grandpa.

520
37:49.320 --> 37:50.560
Let go of me.

521
37:50.640 --> 37:52.680
Don't pretend to be a good person.

522
37:52.760 --> 37:56.040
I know you want Grandpa's inheritance.

523
37:56.120 --> 37:58.720
Which one of us really wants Grandpa's inheritance

524
37:59.240 --> 38:01.080
and keeps trying to drive me out of here?

525
38:01.760 --> 38:04.840
What are you implying? Are you accusing me?

526
38:04.920 --> 38:06.800
Aunt Liu, please let me go.

527
38:06.880 --> 38:07.960
Help.

528
38:10.080 --> 38:11.320
Stop, Grandpa.

529
38:12.640 --> 38:13.840
Let go.

530
38:16.720 --> 38:18.360
You've gone too far.

531
38:19.680 --> 38:21.000
You are not my granddaughter.

532
38:25.440 --> 38:28.000
Don't expect to receive a single baht of my inheritance.

533
38:28.080 --> 38:30.120
You won't get a thing. I'll give it all to Hathaya.

534
38:31.800 --> 38:33.880
Aunt Liu, let me go.

535
38:34.680 --> 38:35.960
Where are you going? Stay.

536
38:36.040 --> 38:38.440
Let go. Let go.

537
38:38.520 --> 38:40.360
I said let go.

538
38:57.960 --> 38:59.120
What was that?

539
38:59.920 --> 39:01.840
What was what? I didn't hear anything.

540
39:20.880 --> 39:24.200
I bought some food for Mr. Pichai. Could you prepare it for him?

541
39:24.280 --> 39:27.360
Perfect timing. It's almost time for him to eat and take his medicine.

542
39:31.360 --> 39:32.400
Oh my God.

543
39:36.240 --> 39:38.600
Grandpa. Grandpa.

544
39:39.760 --> 39:41.120
-Grandpa. -Father.

545
39:41.200 --> 39:42.200
Grandpa.

546
39:43.200 --> 39:45.920
Grandpa. Grandpa. Can you hear me?

547
39:46.000 --> 39:46.920
Blood.

548
39:47.000 --> 39:48.000
-Grandpa. -Sir!

549
39:49.200 --> 39:50.200
-Everyone. -Sir.

550
39:50.800 --> 39:51.960
Everyone, step back.

551
39:53.800 --> 39:55.160
Grandpa.

552
39:55.760 --> 39:58.960
Grandpa, can you hear me? Grandpa.

553
39:59.040 --> 40:00.560
Grandpa.

554
40:00.640 --> 40:03.680
Grandpa, can you hear me?

555
40:03.760 --> 40:04.880
Hello.

556
40:05.800 --> 40:07.920
I need an ambulance urgently. Right now.

557
40:09.760 --> 40:11.720
Yes. Okay.

558
40:13.960 --> 40:15.200
Grandpa.

559
40:15.280 --> 40:16.880
Grandpa.

560
40:17.920 --> 40:19.000
Grandpa.

561
40:21.720 --> 40:25.520
Grandpa, can you hear me?

562
40:25.600 --> 40:27.640
-Grandpa. -Try to stay calm.

563
40:32.760 --> 40:34.360
Grandpa.

564
40:58.280 --> 40:59.320
Try to stay calm.

565
41:00.240 --> 41:03.560
He's with the doctors now. He'll be okay.

566
41:04.080 --> 41:06.680
Grandpa still wasn't fully recovered,

567
41:06.760 --> 41:09.360
and now he fell down the stairs.

568
41:09.440 --> 41:11.360
I'm so worried about him.

569
41:14.400 --> 41:15.800
How is Grandpa?

570
41:16.960 --> 41:19.400
The doctor is treating him, sweetheart.

571
41:23.080 --> 41:25.760
What kind of care is this? How did you let Grandpa leave his room?

572
41:28.080 --> 41:30.080
I was taking good care of him.

573
41:30.160 --> 41:31.920
Aunt Liu called me away to talk.

574
41:32.000 --> 41:36.040
If you want to blame me, then you need to blame your mother too.

575
41:38.160 --> 41:39.600
It was an accident, sweetheart.

576
41:41.680 --> 41:43.000
But something doesn't add up.

577
41:43.840 --> 41:46.200
Hathaya said that when she left,

578
41:47.120 --> 41:48.200
Mr. Pichai was asleep.

579
41:49.480 --> 41:50.920
So how did he get out of the room?

580
41:51.000 --> 41:55.480
Grandpa probably woke up and wanted to get some fresh air outside.

581
41:55.560 --> 41:58.160
Grandpa still isn't strong enough, Aunt Liu.

582
41:58.240 --> 42:00.320
He almost never goes anywhere alone.

583
42:00.400 --> 42:04.120
Ramil and I still have to help him walk every day.

584
42:04.200 --> 42:07.040
I'm certain he didn't come out by himself.

585
42:07.760 --> 42:09.040
What are you saying?

586
42:09.920 --> 42:11.520
Something must have happened

587
42:12.280 --> 42:14.560
that forced Master to leave his room.

588
42:19.640 --> 42:23.800
When Grandpa wakes up, we'll know what happened.

589
42:35.040 --> 42:36.080
Chayanee.

590
42:59.720 --> 43:04.400
Chayanee, what happened? Why did Grandpa fall down the stairs?

591
43:20.000 --> 43:23.560
Grandpa caught me stealing the money. He was going to call the police.

592
43:25.280 --> 43:28.760
So you tried to stop him, and he accidentally fell down the stairs?

593
43:42.800 --> 43:44.760
How could you do that?

594
43:45.560 --> 43:48.040
Do you even realize what you've done?

595
43:50.880 --> 43:54.440
If I hadn't done it, I would've gone to prison, Mom.

596
43:57.680 --> 44:01.720
If Grandpa wakes up, he'll tell everyone what happened.

597
44:02.360 --> 44:05.440
Then you'll be charged with attempted murder.

598
44:07.240 --> 44:08.720
No, Mom.

599
44:08.800 --> 44:11.720
You have to help me. I'm not going to prison.

600
44:11.800 --> 44:13.280
Mom, you have to help me.

601
44:18.040 --> 44:19.120
Chayanee.

602
44:22.240 --> 44:26.160
If Grandpa wakes up, what are we going to do?

603
44:34.320 --> 44:37.000
Doctor, how is Grandpa?

604
44:37.560 --> 44:41.040
His vital signs have improved. He has some bone fractures,

605
44:41.640 --> 44:43.640
but he also suffered trauma to the brain.

606
44:45.280 --> 44:49.920
What does that mean? How serious is his condition?

607
44:50.720 --> 44:53.760
He cannot move his body right now,

608
44:54.480 --> 44:55.880
and he is unable to speak.

609
44:58.080 --> 45:02.040
Can he communicate at all? Even one word at a time?

610
45:07.080 --> 45:09.640
What can I do for him, Doctor?

611
45:10.400 --> 45:14.400
He'll need medication and therapy for some time.

612
45:14.960 --> 45:18.240
I can't tell you how long his recovery will take.

613
45:18.320 --> 45:20.880
It depends on his physical condition and state of mind.

614
45:23.920 --> 45:24.920
Hathaya.

615
45:33.880 --> 45:35.320
Grandpa can't talk.

616
45:36.120 --> 45:38.240
No one will know my secret.

617
45:43.160 --> 45:44.400
Doctor.

618
45:45.840 --> 45:49.120
You have to make Grandpa better.

619
45:49.200 --> 45:51.240
No matter how much it costs,

620
45:51.320 --> 45:53.480
I want my grandpa back the way he was.

621
45:53.560 --> 45:55.920
Doctor, please help us.

622
45:56.520 --> 45:58.200
I'll do everything I can.

623
45:59.200 --> 46:00.200
Excuse me.

624
46:06.480 --> 46:07.800
All this time,

625
46:09.320 --> 46:11.440
I let you take care of Grandpa.

626
46:13.560 --> 46:15.640
But you almost got him killed.

627
46:19.600 --> 46:22.760
From now on, you two don't need to take care of Grandpa anymore.

628
46:24.320 --> 46:26.920
Mom and I will take care of him ourselves.

629
47:17.600 --> 47:21.000
Raiwin. Go throw Chayanee out.

630
47:21.080 --> 47:23.720
Tell her she's not welcome here anymore. Go.

631
47:23.800 --> 47:24.640
Yes.

632
47:28.520 --> 47:29.400
Chayanee.

633
47:30.760 --> 47:34.360
You should go outside. Let's talk outside.

634
47:34.440 --> 47:38.400
Tell her. She's not welcome here, and don't ever come back.

635
47:43.440 --> 47:48.480
I have never met a woman as shameless as you in my entire life.

636
48:03.720 --> 48:05.800
And I've never met anyone as shameless as you.

637
48:11.720 --> 48:13.960
Chayanee, you and I really are

638
48:14.960 --> 48:16.480
cut from the same cloth.

639
48:19.720 --> 48:22.000
All of this should be enough to settle your case.

640
48:22.080 --> 48:24.680
Enough? There's more than enough.

641
48:26.360 --> 48:27.320
Raiwin.

642
48:30.240 --> 48:35.080
You and Chayanee haven't gone out together much lately, have you?

643
48:36.200 --> 48:39.400
Take her out tonight.

644
48:40.240 --> 48:42.280
I'll take care of all this myself.

645
48:44.880 --> 48:47.960
Where do you want to go tonight? I'll take you anywhere you want.

646
48:51.240 --> 48:52.360
No.

647
48:52.960 --> 48:55.800
I'm tired. I don't feel like traveling anywhere.

648
48:56.440 --> 48:57.840
I'd rather party here.

649
48:58.840 --> 49:03.600
Of course. Raiwin, take good care of her.

650
49:03.680 --> 49:06.560
I'm going out to see a friend. I'll put all this away upstairs first.

651
49:12.200 --> 49:15.640
I've done everything for you and Raiwin.

652
49:16.760 --> 49:18.480
I'm not asking for much.

653
49:19.840 --> 49:23.880
Just don't betray me or be ungrateful. That's all I ask.

654
49:26.400 --> 49:28.040
Of course, sweetheart.

655
49:29.160 --> 49:31.800
Raiwin, take good care of her.

656
49:43.640 --> 49:46.480
Do you know why I don't keep dogs or cats?

657
49:46.560 --> 49:47.600
NEXT EPISODE

658
49:47.680 --> 49:51.520
Because I'm afraid that if I keep pets, they might not obey me.

659
49:51.600 --> 49:55.960
I saw you take a lot of money from the safe.

660
49:56.040 --> 49:58.200
Get ready for what's coming.

661
49:58.280 --> 50:00.000
You'd better make sure your mom survives it too.

662
50:00.080 --> 50:02.680
Everything your mom owns belongs to me.

663
50:02.760 --> 50:05.760
Even her life and every breath she takes.

664
50:05.840 --> 50:07.760
No! Chayanee, don't!

665
50:07.840 --> 50:09.520
No! No!

666
52:05.600 --> 52:07.880
Subtitle translation by: Thanit Puncharoen
